OL,4,CSheikh Hasina plans return           W5
OL,5,                                      W5
OL,6,GBangladesh's former prime minister   W5
OL,7,GSheikh Hasina has said she plans to  W5
OL,8,Greturn home on 16 December, more     W5
OL,9,Gthan two years after a popular       W5
OL,10,Guprising forced her from power.      W5
OL,11,                                      W5
OL,12,GHasina, who has lived in exile in    W5
OL,13,GDelhi since August 2024, has asked   W5
OL,14,Gthe Bangladeshi government to fly    W5
OL,15,Gher back to Dhaka, her spokesperson  W5
OL,16,Gsaid.                                W5
